{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious dungeon in this dungeon-crawler RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Gobby, a small goblin wanting to find an exit from this seemingly infinite dungeon. But beware! Deadly traps, mad monsters, and even humans infest the labyrinth. Worse, it seems the place is only growing! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/95cd8f8802903a84cb0d487ffdb47860.poster.avif?t=1768228065\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/95cd8f8802903a84cb0d487ffdb47860.webm?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/95cd8f8802903a84cb0d487ffdb47860.mp4?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 10 interconnected levels with classic grid-like controls. Walk, run, jump, swim, take stairs, and fall across different floors! Meet a varied cast of inhabitants and maybe make some friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/2c035daf97bec2afcea8428f301c42da.poster.avif?t=1768228065\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/2c035daf97bec2afcea8428f301c42da.webm?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/2c035daf97bec2afcea8428f301c42da.mp4?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your dice in turn-based combat. Luck is not something you can rely on. Only your wits will lead you to victory. Unleash unstoppable combos using your dice and skills. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/fc444abeb4e9b8e7a7d6a3e5461294e5.poster.avif?t=1768228065\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/fc444abeb4e9b8e7a7d6a3e5461294e5.webm?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/fc444abeb4e9b8e7a7d6a3e5461294e5.mp4?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack open chests and discover powerful new dice to add to your arsenal. Trade items and abilities with the dungeon merchant. Build yourself a unique dice pool and unlock devastating skills! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 maps with verticality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different types of roaming monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ unique items to customize your dice and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 possible endings to the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of charming characters in an impossible world </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Humble beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/7ac483629fd5eed74721509054271825a1ec6f4b.jpg"},{"name":"Mimic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/b672917dba6e1b47e39523195da635d82065c83c.jpg"},{"name":"Scary Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/14d26d0f9c2d86c9d34e3e001ec5e92c802b2dcc.jpg"},{"name":"SMASH!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/b6cd5ef8cb58929324850d2226d8010fac3fe4f6.jpg"},{"name":"It's on the box art!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/a368135001709f38d1fd8f9e9baac9e7f125cdfa.jpg"},{"name":"Farewell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/9dfc730776d6ce48dda12d06d75233d686570241.jpg"},{"name":"Cheesed to meet you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/c81756685e9ee6738695ebd453350c988ff8577a.jpg"},{"name":"The number of the beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/4a975fc0fdda21c502b6a948b6a24da3c6c26719.jpg"},{"name":"No Joker? Refund!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/edf5a81bf461ce0e366bc561eb7660e8b8112a35.jpg"},{"name":"Ghoulbusters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945950/a13ebba93c9e9a1b79e0f0681b1e32a8a6051cd8.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945950?t=1768228065","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945950?t=1768228065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/b23b3c7187eacdd2b3186af84d5da180f44e4362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768228065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/b23b3c7187eacdd2b3186af84d5da180f44e4362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768228065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious dungeon in this dungeon-crawler RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Gobby, a small goblin wanting to find an exit from this seemingly infinite dungeon. But beware! Deadly traps, mad monsters, and even humans infest the labyrinth. Worse, it seems the place is only growing! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/95cd8f8802903a84cb0d487ffdb47860.poster.avif?t=1768228065\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/95cd8f8802903a84cb0d487ffdb47860.webm?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/95cd8f8802903a84cb0d487ffdb47860.mp4?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 10 interconnected levels with classic grid-like controls. Walk, run, jump, swim, take stairs, and fall across different floors! Meet a varied cast of inhabitants and maybe make some friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/2c035daf97bec2afcea8428f301c42da.poster.avif?t=1768228065\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/2c035daf97bec2afcea8428f301c42da.webm?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/2c035daf97bec2afcea8428f301c42da.mp4?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your dice in turn-based combat. Luck is not something you can rely on. Only your wits will lead you to victory. Unleash unstoppable combos using your dice and skills. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/fc444abeb4e9b8e7a7d6a3e5461294e5.poster.avif?t=1768228065\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/fc444abeb4e9b8e7a7d6a3e5461294e5.webm?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/extras/fc444abeb4e9b8e7a7d6a3e5461294e5.mp4?t=1768228065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack open chests and discover powerful new dice to add to your arsenal. Trade items and abilities with the dungeon merchant. Build yourself a unique dice pool and unlock devastating skills! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 maps with verticality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different types of roaming monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ unique items to customize your dice and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 possible endings to the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of charming characters in an impossible world </p></li></ul>","developers":["Tsukumogami Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945950/header.jpg?t=1768228065","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 - Tsukumogami Software","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS, Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz, Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD Athlon XE BE-2300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz, Intel HD Graphics 5500 , AMD Radeon R5 Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Tested on Steam Deck.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS, Linux distribution released after 2020<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz, Intel Core i5-6600K, AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz,  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050, AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Tested on Steam Deck.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support, Metal 3 support (macOS)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB availabl